        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Set in the near future, the story revolves around the emergence of the virtual dream reality technology \"Good Dreams\",  which allows people to do whatever they desire within their self-created dreams. However, a crisis triggered by these dreams quietly unfolds.",
          "runtime": 111,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Per Aspera Ad Astra"
